# Fyne app (`internal/app`)

See [docs/codebase-map.md](../../docs/codebase-map.md) for file navigation.

## Structure

- Shell nav: Upload → Review → Collections → Rejected (`shell.go`)
- No SQL in widgets — call `internal/store` repositories
- View constructors: `NewUploadView`, `NewReviewView`, `NewCollectionsView`, `NewRejectedView`

## Async and layout

- Heavy work (decode, IO, hashing) off UI thread; Fyne updates on main thread
- Respect minimum sizes in `ux_image_dims.go` — align with UX spec
- Coalesce UI refreshes on rapid scroll/batch updates

## Tests

- Use `fyne.io/fyne/v2/test` for widget tests
- UX capture: `PHOTO_TOOL_UX_JOURNEY_TEST=1` + `PHOTO_TOOL_UX_CAPTURE_DIR`
- Extend `e2e_shell_journeys_test.go` or feature-specific `*_test.go`

## Themes

- Custom theme in `theme.go`; dark default, light peer
- Test override: `PHOTO_TOOL_TEST_THEME` via `applyTestPhotoToolTheme`
